  "tip": "<p>When a scenario emphasizes <i>offline caching</i> on mobile with automatic sync and <i>real time updates</i> for a serverless backend, map that directly to <i>Firestore</i>. If the requirement centers on global relational consistency and SQL, think <i>Spanner</i> instead.</p>",
